==History==
2024
*The Tesla's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 4/3/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/3/2024)|March 2024 Update]].
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], removed the Evolved Tesla's hitpoints boost, but added a pulse after death.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Evolved Tesla’s pulse damage by 22.9% and decreased its pulse stun duration to 0.5 seconds (from 1 second). The same update also fixed a bug with Evolved Tesla's behavior when it is frozen during deployment and an issue where Evolved Tesla was not sending a pulse at death when it wasn't destroyed by another unit.
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Tesla’s damage by 4% and increased its attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Tesla’s attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds), but removed its death pulse.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Tesla after death.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], made it so that [[Lumberjack/Evolution|Lumberjack Ghost]] is immune to Evolved Tesla's pulse.
*On 9/4/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/4/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Tesla's pulse damage by 17%.
2026

* On 4/5/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Tesla's pulse damage by 15%.
* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Tesla's lifetime to 25 seconds (from 30 seconds). It also increased its hitpoints by 3%

